// SIRENSCALL_CHASER_FIX_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2798845851" "You keep treating this Skiff like it's a punching bag, I'm going to start treating you like one."
// SIRENSCALL_CHASER_FIX_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1746089582" "Sheesh.  Did the wall fight back?"
// SIRENSCALL_CHASER_FIX_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1812232174" "You treat that skiff like it's your personal bumper car.  Knock it off."
// SIRENSCALL_CHASER_FIX_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P682850495" "I've seen worse.  It'll take some time to fix, though."
// SIRENSCALL_CHASER_FIX_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P347645490" "Here's a tip:  when you're in a dogfight?  Try not to get hit."
// SIRENSCALL_CHASER_FIX_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3929453643" "Wow, it sounds rough. We're going to have to take her off rotation."

// SIRENSCALL_CHASER_FIX_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P486557021" "Repairs are gonna have to wait!"
// SIRENSCALL_CHASER_FIX_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2989521140" "Take care of it!"
// SIRENSCALL_CHASER_FIX_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1305041670" "A few more bumps won't hurt that thing!"
// SIRENSCALL_CHASER_FIX_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3467521772" "Time to introduce this punk to the SkyRaiders!"

// SIRENSCALL_BEINGCHECKED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4189659521" "All I want to know is, how long?"
// SIRENSCALL_BEINGCHECKED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2853960281" "Yeah, real witty.  Just fix it."
// SIRENSCALL_BEINGCHECKED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3256040726" "Funny.  Fix it, will ya?"
// SIRENSCALL_BEINGCHECKED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3967297411" "Just fix it already.  Keep the witty commentary to yourself."

// SIRENSCALL_SKIFF_BEINGCHECKED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3246159775" "Pithy banter will have to wait!  We got wannabees!"
// SIRENSCALL_SKIFF_BEINGCHECKED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2378323538" "Hold up!  We got company!"
// SIRENSCALL_SKIFF_BEINGCHECKED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3178375819" "Here we go!"

// SIRENSCALL_SKIFF_FIX_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1010403757" "A few more adjustments, I should think."
// SIRENSCALL_SKIFF_FIX_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4099295420" "Without a proper maintenance hanger, this will have to do."
// SIRENSCALL_SKIFF_FIX_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P661135889" "I can't keep patching this thing up.   Eventually it'll need to go in for full maintenance."

// SIRENSCALL_SKIFF_FIX_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3619240760" "Go go go!"
// SIRENSCALL_SKIFF_FIX_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1641870444" "Just deal with the rogue!  I got your back when you're done!"
// SIRENSCALL_SKIFF_FIX_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4221349933" "Get them!"

// SHARKHEAD_AIRSTRIP_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P817562368" "We must defend this airstrip!"
// SHARKHEAD_AIRSTRIP_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1281141804" "This airstrip is absolutely critical for our mission."
// SHARKHEAD_AIRSTRIP_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3778073306" "Make sure everyone present is authorized to be here."
// SHARKHEAD_AIRSTRIP_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3792654238" "Check everyone. And look under those masks this time. THAT was a brilliant idea."

// SHARKHEAD_AIRSTRIP_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2301386283" "You are not allowed to be here!"
// SHARKHEAD_AIRSTRIP_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P96618988" "We'll escort you out now, with force if necessary."
// SHARKHEAD_AIRSTRIP_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2032332914" "Intruders! Call for backup!"

// SHARKHEAD_VILLA_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
"P1883702944" "Haven't seen any trouble yet."
// SHARKHEAD_VILLA_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
"P901105518" "Nuthin' out there."
// SHARKHEAD_VILLA_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
"P1947832222" "What? I don't see nuthin'."

// SHARKHEAD_VILLA_FAMILY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P362016325" "Ah! There's the chump. Get him!"
// SHARKHEAD_VILLA_FAMILY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1921858127" "I don't know how I didn't see the costume earlier. I'll take care of him."
// SHARKHEAD_VILLA_FAMILY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3875460596" "Whoa! Where'd you come from?!"

// SHARKHEAD_VILLA_SKYRAIDER_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
"P3386074591" "Sector clear."
// SHARKHEAD_VILLA_SKYRAIDER_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
"P2412392312" "There is nothing on the horizon."
// SHARKHEAD_VILLA_SKYRAIDER_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
"P314566976" "All clear, no intruders detected."

// SHARKHEAD_VILLA_SKYRAIDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P993207549" "Engage the enemy!"
// SHARKHEAD_VILLA_SKYRAIDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2060319726" "Intruders must be stopped!"
// SHARKHEAD_VILLA_SKYRAIDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P601285095" "You will not win!"

// SHARKHEAD_WELDING_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2745599164" "Make sure you seal that up good. We can't afford to waste materials."
// SHARKHEAD_WELDING_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3630981131" "Perhaps our combat teams should learn to respect the equipment a little more. It gets expensive repairing these."
// SHARKHEAD_WELDING_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4160783249" "Excellent, repairs are almost complete. Colonel Duray will be pleased."

// SHARKHEAD_WELDING_OVERSEER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1747100595" "Put that welder to good use and light this intruder up!"
// SHARKHEAD_WELDING_OVERSEER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1734335123" "Stop him before he causes more damage!"
// SHARKHEAD_WELDING_OVERSEER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2247318349" "You cannot stop us!"

// SHARKHEAD_SRAIDER_ORDERS_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P731619833" "Keep up the excellent work, men. We're on schedule."
// SHARKHEAD_SRAIDER_ORDERS_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2833321742" "Your orders are to protect the airstrip at all costs!"
// SHARKHEAD_SRAIDER_ORDERS_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1411628947" "You have fallen behind on your repair work. This is unacceptable!"

// SHARKHEAD_ORDERS_INSTRUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2378130036" "Can't you see I'm busy?"
// SHARKHEAD_ORDERS_INSTRUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1483524702" "First one to take out this trash doesn't have to do KP for a week!"
// SHARKHEAD_ORDERS_INSTRUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1124791862" "Heads up, soldiers! We're under attack!"

// SHARKHEAD_PATROL_JUMPBOTS_PIT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P218553256" "Awaiting orders..."
// SHARKHEAD_PATROL_JUMPBOTS_PIT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1443751483" "Central Command, sector Bravo clear. Awaiting orders..."
// SHARKHEAD_PATROL_JUMPBOTS_PIT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2216816100" "Central Command, analysis complete, no anomalies to report. Awaiting orders..."
// SHARKHEAD_PATROL_JUMPBOTS_PIT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4119723283" "10...GOTO 10..."

// SHARKHEAD_PATROL_JUMPBOTS_ROAD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P220779268" "Central Command, intruder alert. Engaging enemy."
// SHARKHEAD_PATROL_JUMPBOTS_ROAD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3133108625" "Central Command, intruder alert. Back-up requested."
// SHARKHEAD_PATROL_JUMPBOTS_ROAD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P978132788" "Central Command, attack orders acknowledged."

// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P611711483" "Central, this is Scout Team Alpha reporting. Sector is clear."
// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1170596318" "Reporting in. All areas clear."
// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4105457848" "Central, this is Scout Team Alpha reporting. Where is my relief? I am needed at Sector Theta."

// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1824798783" "Central, we have an intruder, send back-up!"
// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P651255614" "Central, intruder spotted as expected. Proceed with the next phase!"
// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1796127306" "You may defeat me, but you can't defeat us all."

// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_SKYSELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2078832114" "I have some technology that may prove useful to you."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_SKYSELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2992094231" "Our jetpacks are top notch."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_SKYSELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1748116833" "With our teleport packs, you can move several miles in just moments."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_SKYSELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3218246993" "I know I should back toe the latrine, but it's just so much more fun to teleport in and scare everyone."

// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_SKYSELLER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1492739389" "This sale was critical for us! How dare you intervene!"
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_SKYSELLER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2489319305" "The Family set us up!"
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_SKYSELLER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P888246395" "You will not interrupt our business!"

// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_FAMILYBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2046391802" "Interesting."
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_FAMILYBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1776933930" "We could use some of this!"
// SHARKHEAD_SHADYDEAL_FAMILYBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3354315449" "Wow, that's impressive. We would like to do further business with you."

// SHARKHEAD_SKIFF_BEINGCHECKED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2248342484" "I don't see anything wrong with this skiff."
// SHARKHEAD_SKIFF_BEINGCHECKED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2791828908" "The fuel line has a small leak and needs to be repaired."
// SHARKHEAD_SKIFF_BEINGCHECKED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3358809036" "There's nothing wrong with the skiff, but you seem awfully pale, Sir. Perhaps you should go to the infirmary?"

// SHARKHEAD_SKIFF_BEINGCHECKED_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P693010794" "Crud. The skiff isn't ready yet. It'll have to do."
// SHARKHEAD_SKIFF_BEINGCHECKED_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4199462513" "This skiff will wipe the floor with you."
// SHARKHEAD_SKIFF_BEINGCHECKED_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1281476213" "Don't worry. I just finished the skiff. It's fully operational."

// SHARKHEAD_SKIFF_FIX_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1814272229" "How bad is the damage?"
// SHARKHEAD_SKIFF_FIX_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2402748861" "Man, these guys are reckless with these machines."
// SHARKHEAD_SKIFF_FIX_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2301197349" "Almost done with that engine repair?"

// SHARKHEAD_SKIFF_FIX_OBSERVER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2974015809" "Oh, that's fair. Pick on a mechanic."
// SHARKHEAD_SKIFF_FIX_OBSERVER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1635359585" "Will you stop meddling in our repairs?"
// SHARKHEAD_SKIFF_FIX_OBSERVER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3119078282" "We've been expecting you. You'll not get past us."

// SHARKHEAD_SRAIDER_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1631445221" "Welcome to our squadron. Now get to work!"
// SHARKHEAD_SRAIDER_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P245762990" "Squad 1 will begin repairs on damaged skiffs. Squad 2 will clean the mess hall. Questions? Too bad."
// SHARKHEAD_SRAIDER_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4170483362" "You have to be prepared for combat at any time. Just last week I was in the latrine when these capes come swooping out of nowhere. Did I cry about it? Nope."

// SHARKHEAD_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P58017851" "This is not a drill! Attack!"
// SHARKHEAD_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1890838230" "Orders have changed, engage the intruder!"
// SHARKHEAD_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P408830921" "Here's your first test, cadets! If you survive this, you're in."

// SHARKHEAD_SRAIDER_DRILLYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P520630475" "Hut, two, three, four! Right-face!"
// SHARKHEAD_SRAIDER_DRILLYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P88430342" "Left-face! Hut, two, three, four!"
// SHARKHEAD_SRAIDER_DRILLYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3693726279" "Keep in cadence! Hut, two, three, four!"
// SHARKHEAD_SRAIDER_DRILLYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1174776877" "I KNOW A GIRL WHO LIVES ON THE HILL..."

// SHARKHEAD_DRILLYELL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1778290167" "Keep the ranks, men! Fire at will!"
// SHARKHEAD_DRILLYELL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2695142811" "Squadron, attack!"
// SHARKHEAD_DRILLYELL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3711001368" "No man left behind! Move out!"

