// SHARKHEAD_PIT_AIRASSAULT_AIRATTACKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1796959645" "I'm on it!  I'm blowing up everything I see.  This really IS a pit!"
// SHARKHEAD_PIT_AIRASSAULT_AIRATTACKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
